.SH RETURN VALUE
.B \%bkgrndset
and
.B \%wbkgrndset
do not return a value.
.PP
Functions returning an
.I int
return
.B ERR
upon failure and
.B OK
upon success.
In
.IR \%ncurses ","
failure occurs if
.bP
the
.I curses
screen has not been initialized,
.bP
.I win
is
.IR NULL ","
or
.bP
.I wch
is
.IR NULL "."
